# Direct dependencies of the MkDocs preset, one exact pin each. requirements.txt is the
# lock compiled from this file: every package the preset installs, pinned with hashes.
# Change a pin here, then regenerate the lock from this directory with the command
# recorded in the requirements.txt header (Renovate runs the same command). Keep '='
# between each option and its argument: Renovate skips a lock whose header separates them
# with a space or uses a short option, and CI rejects such a header.
